graph TB
    subgraph "mcp-lifecycle-operator"
        subgraph ControllerManager["mcp-lifecycle-operator-controller-manager<br/>(Deployment)"]
            Reconciler[MCPServerReconciler<br/>controller-runtime v0.24.1]
            HealthProbe[Health Probes<br/>:8081/healthz, /readyz]
            MetricsServer[Metrics Server<br/>:8443 HTTPS<br/>TokenReview + SAR Auth]
        end
    end

    User[Platform User / Admin] -->|creates/updates| MCPServerCR[MCPServer CR<br/>mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1<br/>Namespaced]

    MCPServerCR -->|"watched by (For)"| Reconciler

    Reconciler -->|creates/updates<br/>ownerRef| ManagedDeployment[Managed Deployment<br/>MCP Server Container]
    Reconciler -->|creates/updates<br/>ownerRef| ManagedService[Managed Service<br/>MCP Server Port]
    Reconciler -->|creates/updates<br/>ownerRef| ManagedNetPolicy[Managed NetworkPolicy]

    Reconciler -->|watches| ConfigMaps[ConfigMaps]
    Reconciler -->|watches| Secrets[Secrets]
    Reconciler -->|reads| Pods[Pods]

    Reconciler -->|"REST/WSS :6443<br/>TLS 1.2+"| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API Server]

    Prometheus[Prometheus] -->|scrapes :8443<br/>HTTPS + authn/authz| MetricsServer

    subgraph "Managed Resources (per MCPServer)"
        ManagedDeployment
        ManagedService
        ManagedNetPolicy
    end

    style Reconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HealthProbe fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style MetricsServer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style MCPServerCR fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style ManagedDeployment fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ManagedService fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ManagedNetPolicy fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ConfigMaps fill:#e8e8e8
    style Secrets fill:#e8e8e8
    style Pods fill:#e8e8e8
    style K8sAPI fill:#e8e8e8
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8
